  "notes": "{求|もと}める is an ichidan verb with three main meanings: seek, request, and buy (formal).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle for the object sought\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{幸|しあわ}せ→幸せ：01420_shiawase⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{求|もと}める: to seek happiness\n- ⟦{助|たす}け→助け：07777_tasuke⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{求|もと}める: to seek help\n- ⟦{許可|きょか}→許可：00259_kyoka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{求|もと}める: to request permission\n- ⟦{説明|せつめい}→説明：01449_setsumei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{求|もと}める: to demand an explanation\n\nFORMAL 'BUY' USAGE:\nThe meaning \"to buy/purchase\" is formal and often appears in commercial contexts:\n- お{求|もと}めやすい⟦{価格|かかく}→価格：00147_kakaku⟧: affordable price\n- どちらで{求|もと}めましたか: Where did you purchase it?\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{探|さが}す→探す：00493_sagasu⟧: to search for (physical searching)\n- ⟦{頼|たの}む→頼む：01104_tanomu⟧: to request (less formal)\n- ⟦{買|か}う→買う：00489_kau⟧: to buy (everyday usage)",
